OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 9 DEC
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GIn a special concert marking his
OL,6,     G85th birthday, American pianist
OL,7,     GStephen Kovacevich is joined by
OL,8,     GMartha Argerich and the violinist
OL,9,     GIrene Duval.
OL,10,G2145FThe Essay: Scotland in Song
OL,11,     GMusic knows many different forms
OL,12,     Gin Scotland, as a result of her
OL,13,     Gradically different traditions.
OL,14,     GPoet Kenneth Steven chooses to
OL,15,     Gexplore the stories of five
OL,16,     Gcomposers.
OL,17,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,18,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,19,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,20,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,21,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,22,     Geverything in between.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
